  "approvalLimit": "Any later human acceptance applies to this displayed candidate, its app palette and representative selection coverage. It does not certify manufacturer-exact estimated geometry or color, global roof G1/C1 continuity, or a visual sweep of all 30 contacts. It does not certify welded exported watertightness, universal corner-normal alignment or ergonomic safety.",
  "limits": "Whole raw images; no crop, registration, tracing, pixel-derived geometry, or automatic shape inference. Neutral app frames are historical. Final native/export measurements are finite technical probes; source fidelity and actual-app appearance require the retained Opus and human reviews. Mint is the app palette, not a manufacturer color or texture claim. The center-jug rear return and finger-room profile are operator-selected display adaptations responding to user feedback. The retained manufacturer front photographs, comparison sheet and mounting instructions do not establish a definitive rear profile or any incut dimension. The 55/65 mm sloper support depths remain sourced; locating those support bands from the front backward is an explicitly labeled interpretation and display adaptation. No material chemistry, manufacturer mint color, global roof G1/C1 continuity or exact estimated thickness is claimed. Exact exported semantic topology and corner-normal sliver limits are retained explicitly; no welded export watertightness, universal normal alignment or continuous Hausdorff proof is claimed.",
